  "表計算の基本: 文字の配置(左・中央・右)、数の見せ方(桁区切り・パーセント・小数の桁)、IF・COUNTIF・ROUND などの関数、$ の付いた絶対参照、並べ替え・絞り込み(表の道具の帯)。この表は「区分」で絞り込んで「欠席」の行を隠しています。帯の右端の「全画面」で、表を画面の幅いっぱいに広げて編集できます。見出しの行は、行の高さを変えて高くしています。": "Spreadsheet basics: text alignment (left, center, right), number display (thousands separators, percent, decimal places), functions such as IF, COUNTIF and ROUND, absolute references with $, and sorting and filtering (the table toolbar). This table is filtered by \"Group\" to hide the \"Absent\" rows. With \"Full screen\" at the right end of the toolbar you can widen the table to the full width of the screen and edit it there. The header row has been made taller by changing the row height.",
