  "データベースの列には、複数選択(「,」で区切った名前ごとの札)・状態(未着手・進行中・完了の組の色)・URL・メール・電話(押すと開く。読めない形は波線)・ファイル(この文書の添付へのリンク)・作成日時と更新日時(行を足す・変えると自動で入る)も使えます。表の道具の帯の「グループ」で、列の値ごとに行をまとめられます(組の頭を押すと畳む)。この表は「状態」でまとめて、「完了」の組を畳んでいます。": "A database column can also be a multi-select (a tag for each name separated by \",\"), a status (colors for the not started, in progress, and done groups), a URL, an email, a phone number (click to open; a form that cannot be read gets a wavy underline), a file (a link to an attachment in this document), or a created or edited time (filled in automatically when a row is added or changed). With \"Group\" in the table toolbar you can gather rows by the value of a column (click the head of a group to fold it). This table is grouped by \"Status\" and the \"Done\" group is folded.",
  "タグ": "Tags",
